WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,800
I want to exchange some food with you

2
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:02,800
What to exchange for

3
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:04,800
I'll ask my dad to give you the money after you're rescued.

4
00:00:04,800 --> 00:00:06,800
One hundred thousand, hundreds of thousands, you make an offer

5
00:00:06,800 --> 00:00:07,800
why are you laughing

6
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:09,800
My dad is really rich and I won’t default on my debts

7
00:00:09,800 --> 00:00:12,490
Miss Xu, are you not thinking well?

8
00:00:12,490 --> 00:00:14,690
We are on a desert island now, not in your living room.

9
00:00:14,690 --> 00:00:16,890
After you are rescued, you can give me money in exchange for tonight's meat.

10
00:00:16,890 --> 00:00:18,490
This is not called a transaction, this is called giving me a brush.

11
00:00:18,490 --> 00:00:19,690
I didn't mean that

12
00:00:19,690 --> 00:00:21,490
One million cannot buy a bottle of water here

13
00:00:21,490 --> 00:00:22,490
Can't light a fire

14
00:00:22,490 --> 00:00:25,290
I really want to change. Just take what you have now and what I need now.

15
00:00:25,290 --> 00:00:27,750
Don't play with me anymore

16
00:00:27,750 --> 00:00:28,950
Then I can work

17
00:00:28,950 --> 00:00:31,500
I can learn whatever I know how to do

18
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:35,110
Wait until I find a job suitable for you. Not available today.

19
00:00:35,110 --> 00:00:36,710
And go back and tell Xue Ya

20
00:00:36,710 --> 00:00:38,310
If she wants to keep the lighter, she can keep it.

21
00:00:38,310 --> 00:00:42,030
Don't think you can kill me if you take that.

22
00:00:42,030 --> 00:00:44,430
Where have you been? Everyone has been looking for you for hours.
